ra2-r2trrifle-name = Mechanized Rifleman
ra2-turkey-ship = Naval vessel
ra2-r2trrifle-description = Burst-fire infantry. Strong vs infantry, weak vs armor and
    air.
    Near Aras-8 or Deniz Kaplan: +15% damage and +10% speed.

ra2-r2trat-name = Portable AT Specialist
ra2-r2trat-description = Anti-armor ambusher. Conceals while stationary; firing,
    movement or damage reveals him.
    Weak vs infantry and aircraft. Minimum range: 1 cell.

ra2-r2trdroneop-name = Forward Drone Operator
ra2-r2trdroneop-description = Recon and cloak detection. Marks enemy ground targets for 20%
    extra damage for 7 seconds.
    No direct damage; protect with a combat escort. Marks do not
    stack.

ra2-r2greywolf-name = Grey Wolf
ra2-r2greywolf-description = Elite command commando. Conceals while stationary.
    Nearby Turkish infantry have 10% shorter reloads; bonuses do
    not stack. Maximum one. No demolition.

ra2-r2aras-name = Aras-8 Infantry Carrier
ra2-r2aras-description = Fast armored transport for five infantry. Light autocannon.
    Nearby Turkish infantry gain 15% firepower and 10% speed.
    Bonuses do not stack.

ra2-r2gokkalkan-name = Gokkalkan Air Defense
ra2-r2gokkalkan-description = Mobile missile air defense. Strong vs aircraft; cannot attack
    ground targets.
    Escort tanks and transports.

ra2-r2deniz-name = Deniz Kaplan Amphibious Carrier
ra2-r2deniz-description = Armed amphibious transport for five infantry. Crosses land and
    water; unload on clear shores.
    Supports nearby Turkish infantry like Aras-8. Not a vehicle
    landing craft.

ra2-r2turna-name = Turna-AH Gunship
ra2-r2turna-description = Armored ground-attack helicopter with twin missiles and
    rotating rotor.
    Strong vs armor; vulnerable to anti-air. Lands when idle.

ra2-r2sahin-name = Sahin-X Interceptor
ra2-r2sahin-description = Fast air-superiority fighter. Four missiles; automatically
    returns to Airforce Command to rearm.
    Cannot attack ground targets. Requires Battle Lab.

ra2-r2marmara-name = Marmara Frigate
ra2-r2marmara-description = Heavy naval gun and area air defense. Long-range shore
    bombardment.
    Slow and expensive; escort against submarines.

ra2-r2ege-name = Ege Missile Corvette
ra2-r2ege-description = Fast anti-ship missiles and anti-submarine depth charges.
    Detects submarines. Vulnerable to aircraft.

ra2-r2poyraz-name = Poyraz Patrol Craft
ra2-r2poyraz-description = Affordable fast coastal scout with autocannon and sonar.
    Strong vs light targets; needs Ege support against submerged
    enemies.

ra2-r2hisar-name = Hisar Sentry Turret
ra2-r2hisar-description = Twin-gun anti-infantry defense. Requires power.
    Weak vs heavy armor and aircraft.

ra2-r2siper-name = Siper Air-Defense Battery
ra2-r2siper-description = Long-range twin missile defense against aircraft only.
    Requires radar and power. Protect it from ground attacks.

ra2-r2boran-name = Boran Anti-Armor Turret
ra2-r2boran-description = Heavy cannon defense against vehicles and ships. Requires
    power.
    Weak at close range and cannot attack aircraft.
